{"v":4,"catch":"一大群喜歡網球的人！","desc":"“PRO TENNIS WORLD COURT”是由NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1988年發行的一款體育遊戲。從來自世界各地的20名獨特球員中選擇你最喜歡的球員！ 你可以打雙打，也可以打單打。 享受激動人心的網球。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-05-12","genres":["運動","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1513405480b0aa7efaa95241edae8a506381c3c64e6c44c87b2bfd707c26d112.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4049bea3663b7a58cd81037c2b7e0c563e22cba101a970ae7825a5644dafbf34.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6553a64146d0a3738bf6857da5c95d338c92a41a3239b55946853798a2d6035d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aa9be327efcf984687d05d215d2cb6c6bc045b7c68ea9a589a045d5455f1df2f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b62bb98c9e93d903fa16183bbb5dc8bfdfb00e0d0ec7fbbb590e408edc39cdb5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/523370cdf1445c720465a8735fee9c67fb33ca827d0837e5018a888233f8d5c6.jpg"],"titleId":"010075c0178ea000","dlc":[]}